    "details": "The GStreamer project reports:\n\n> Multiple security issues were identified and fixed in the GStreamer\n> framework.\n>\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0078: Type confusion crash in GValue list\n>   comparison when parsing caps\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0083: Out-of-bounds read and write in GStreamer\n>   video meta deserialization\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0084: Out-of-bounds read in the RTSP KeyMgmt\n>   header parser\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0085: Stack-based out-of-bounds write in closed\n>   caption converter and combiner\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0086: Out-of-bounds read in H.265 RTP depayloader\n>   when processing short packets\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0087: Excessive memory allocation in the ASF\n>   demuxer\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0088: Heap out-of-bounds write in RTP L8/L16/L24\n>   audio depayloaders\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0089: Integer overflow and out-of-bounds read in\n>   Matroska demuxer Xiph codec data parser\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0090: Arbitrary element instantiation in GStreamer\n>   Editing Services project file loader\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0091: Out-of-bounds read in RTCP SDES privately\n>   defined entry handling\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0092: Out-of-bounds read in SVG image decoder\n",
    "id": "FreeBSD-2026-0508",
